  "description": "High-performance CSV, Fixed-Width, Excel (.xlsx), JSONL, and HTB (High-Throughput Tabular Binary) parser and writer for .NET 8+. SIMD-accelerated, low-allocation parsing with fluent read/write APIs. Fixed-Width support includes field alignment, padding, overflow handling, and async streaming. Excel reading and writing use no extra dependencies. JSONL supports AI/ML pipelines, CSV-to-JSONL conversion, embedding-API batching, and AOT-safe JsonTypeInfo. HTB supports float[] arrays for vector embedding serialization with endianness safety. Includes async I/O, source generators for native AOT, IDataReader/DbDataReader bridges, PipeReader streaming, LINQ-style extensions, progress reporting, and custom type converters.",
  "id": "HeroParser",
