  "releaseNotes": "v2.8.2 fixes CSV/Fixed-Width streaming lifecycle, Unicode padding, BOM, source-line and record-limit correctness, and segmented CSV comment handling. Benchmark validation now compares equivalent full workloads. No unverified performance improvement is claimed. Changelog: https://github.com/KoalaFacts/HeroParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
